7. JWT TOKEN HANDLING IN FRONTEND
============================================================

After login:

localStorage.setItem("token", data.token);


Get token:

const token = localStorage.getItem("token");


Send token:

headers: {
    "Authorization": "Bearer " + token,
    "Content-Type": "application/json"
}


Logout:

localStorage.removeItem("token");


