12. API STATUS CODES
============================================================

200 OK
Request successful.

201 CREATED
New record created.

400 BAD REQUEST
Invalid request data.

401 UNAUTHORIZED
JWT missing or invalid.

403 FORBIDDEN
User is authenticated but does not have permission,
OR the endpoint requires authentication and no valid
authentication was provided.

404 NOT FOUND
API endpoint or requested record does not exist.

500 INTERNAL SERVER ERROR
Backend/server/database error.


